# R CMD check output: a full stale DUPLICATE of the package, ~99 MB. It was swept in by a
# `git add -A` run while a check was on disk, and every grep of the repo then found two
# copies of every file - the live one and a stale one under here.
# simulation OUTPUT written by the examples, vignettes and quickstart.R - these are products
# of running the package, not part of it (~45 MB of state.tsv / plasmo.trees)
runs/
quickstart-runs/

